{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:42 2026-11-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:42 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:42 2026-11-24 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb「慈雲山資訊交流」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7da9a45ed4e6d4e3f76651fd9fb687f6/2026-11/page_208.jpg\"/><p>慈雲山有學生被車撞倒。今日（24日）中午12時40分，一輛Tesla電動車在慈雲山道8號德愛中學對開，撞倒一名過路的17歲男學生。現場所見，男學生橫過安全島，他被撞後背部及左手受傷，需由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。警方正調查事故原因。</p><img alt=\"fb「慈雲山資訊交流」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec50ba48a9101fb986866503cfa4d75b/2026-11/924050156_122237644226382763_4178595423618082976_n.jpg\" title=\"fb「慈雲山資訊交流」圖片\"/><p>fb「慈雲山資訊交流」圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:03:53.526944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:42:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:25.136994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:57:19.585894+00:00","content_hash":"e9573f699ab2ada02d07c45e7dfa1f02a5cb6ea6e12c2b77210aed66f7aeb164","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}